  "telemetry_interpretation": "The ToolDamage string references are field labels in four event-record serializers. They call the event-ID/counter serializer at 0xed3d30 and field writers at 0xed2620/0xed2600; their callers are rock/tree/catch reporting paths. Their value comes through 0xe89360 -> 0xaa7700, the same packed current-damage getter used by the wear helpers. These serializers report the field; they do not mutate it or flush saves.",
  "remaining_blockers": [
